<%- include('../partials/head', {theme}) %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
<div class="container" style="padding-top: var(--s-12); max-width: 720px;">
  <div class="section-label">Safety</div>
  <h1 class="italic-serif mb-4">Designed with care. Built with boundaries.</h1>
  <p class="text-2 mb-8">Your safety is our priority. Manasyn is not a replacement for professional mental health care.</p>
  <div class="crisis-banner mb-8">
    <div class="crisis-banner__icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></div>
    <div class="crisis-banner__text"><strong>If you are in crisis or feeling unsafe:</strong> Please contact a crisis helpline or emergency services immediately. In India, call <strong>112</strong> for emergencies or <strong>iCall at 9152987821</strong> for mental health support.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">AI is not a replacement</div><p>Manasyn provides supportive conversation and learning tools. It does not diagnose, treat, or replace professional mental health care. If you are experiencing persistent distress, please consult a qualified mental health professional.</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">Privacy</div><p>Your conversations are private. You can export or delete your data at any time from Settings. We do not share your data with third parties.</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">Crisis detection</div><p>When Manasyn detects language suggesting you may be in crisis, it will provide crisis resource information and encourage you to seek professional help.</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">User control</div><p>You decide what to share, when to reflect, and how far to go. Nothing is forced. You can delete your account and all data at any time.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-label">When to seek professional support</div><p>Manasyn is appropriate for self-reflection, learning, and mild everyday stress. It is not appropriate if you are experiencing: thoughts of self-harm, severe depression, psychosis, substance dependence, or any condition requiring clinical intervention.</p></div>
  <div class="text-center mt-8"><a href="/crisis-resources" class="btn btn--primary">View crisis resources</a></div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>